# An allowlist: only the files the pipelines image needs are sent to the build, so secrets such as .env,
# local environments, and Git history can never end up in an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!pipelines/
!transform/
**/__pycache__
transform/target/
transform/logs/
transform/dbt_packages/
transform/.user.yml
